WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.089
Hi, I'm Dr. Afya.

00:00:02.089 --> 00:00:04.669
Here's how AfyaConnect works.

00:00:04.969 --> 00:00:06.472
We help you see a specialist,

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:08.164
and keep your whole care journey

00:00:08.164 --> 00:00:08.853
in one place.

00:00:09.452 --> 00:00:09.783
One.

00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:12.513
Register with your phone number and ID.

00:00:12.513 --> 00:00:14.415
It takes about two minutes.

00:00:15.016 --> 00:00:15.329
Two.

00:00:15.329 --> 00:00:17.366
Choose a verified specialist,

00:00:17.366 --> 00:00:18.149
pick a time,

00:00:18.149 --> 00:00:20.186
and send your booking request.

00:00:20.786 --> 00:00:21.218
Three.

00:00:21.218 --> 00:00:22.585
Your doctor confirms,

00:00:22.585 --> 00:00:24.095
and you both get the video

00:00:24.095 --> 00:00:26.326
link, with reminders by text message

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:27.189
and in the app.

00:00:27.789 --> 00:00:28.101
Four.

00:00:28.101 --> 00:00:29.036
After your visit,

00:00:29.036 --> 00:00:31.031
the summary and your prescription are

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.527
added to your health record.

00:00:32.827 --> 00:00:34.140
A doctor can open your file

00:00:34.140 --> 00:00:35.990
only after confirming your booking,

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:37.184
and you can turn that off

00:00:37.184 --> 00:00:37.781
at any time.

00:00:38.381 --> 00:00:38.736
Five.

00:00:38.736 --> 00:00:40.580
We keep reminding you until you

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.495
choose the pharmacy you prefer.

00:00:43.094 --> 00:00:44.799
You will find everything in these

00:00:44.799 --> 00:00:46.199
tabs: Home, Appointments,

00:00:46.199 --> 00:00:47.964
Health record, and your care plan.

00:00:48.564 --> 00:00:49.155
Ready?

00:00:49.155 --> 00:00:51.224
Tap Create your account.

00:00:51.224 --> 00:00:52.504
See you inside!

